"Closing the window keeps Aerial running in the background" = "关闭窗口后 Aerial 仍在后台运行";
"Move your downloaded videos and any custom source packs to Aerial 4" = "将已下载的视频和自定义来源包迁移到 Aerial 4";
"Carry over some key basic settings" = "保留部分关键基础设置";
"Filters, favorites, overlays and other detailed settings start fresh in Aerial 4" = "筛选、收藏、叠加层和其他详细设置将在 Aerial 4 中重新开始";
"The old container is moved (not copied) — disk space is freed automatically" = "旧容器会被移动而不是复制，磁盘空间会自动释放";
"Start Aerial 4 with default settings — nothing is carried over" = "以默认设置启动 Aerial 4，不迁移任何内容";
"*Delete* the legacy install to reclaim disk space" = "*删除*旧版安装以释放磁盘空间";
"Leave the old install untouched (you can remove it manually later)" = "保留旧版安装不动（之后可以手动删除）";
"The old data is moved (not copied) — disk space is freed automatically" = "旧数据会被移动而不是复制，磁盘空间会自动释放";
"If the wallpaper extension can't read that folder, Aerial offers to move or convert it next" = "如果墙纸扩展无法读取该文件夹，Aerial 之后会提示移动或转换";
"Everything else stays where it is" = "其他内容保持原位";
"Leave the old data untouched (you can remove it manually later)" = "保留旧数据不动（之后可以手动删除）";
"The wallpaper extension plays from the image, attached by Aerial when it starts" = "墙纸扩展会从映像播放，Aerial 启动时会自动挂载";
"Switch off the custom cache location — the wallpaper extension plays from the default cache right away" = "关闭自定义缓存位置，墙纸扩展会立即从默认缓存播放";
"Videos are downloaded again to the internal disk as needed" = "需要的视频会重新下载到内置磁盘";
"Keep the current setting for now" = "暂时保留当前设置";
"Nothing plays on the desktop until the videos are moved or the folder is converted" = "在视频被移动或文件夹被转换之前，桌面不会播放任何内容";
"This page comes back the next time Aerial starts" = "下次启动 Aerial 时会再次显示此页面";
"Click **Show old files in Finder** — Finder selects the old `Aerial` folder." = "点击**在访达中显示旧文件**，访达会选中旧的 `Aerial` 文件夹。";
"Delete that folder (and, if you like, `Preferences/com.glouel.Aerial.plist` next to it)." = "删除该文件夹（如果需要，也可以删除旁边的 `Preferences/com.glouel.Aerial.plist`）。";
"Click **Continue**. Aerial 4 starts with default settings." = "点击**继续**。Aerial 4 将以默认设置启动。";
"Click **Open both folders** — the old `Aerial` folder and a new `Aerial-migrate` folder in /Users/Shared." = "点击**打开两个文件夹**，会打开旧的 `Aerial` 文件夹和 /Users/Shared 中新建的 `Aerial-migrate` 文件夹。";
"Drag `Cache`, `Thumbnails` and any source folders (e.g. “macOS 26”) from the old folder into `Aerial-migrate`. Optional: also `Preferences/com.glouel.Aerial.plist` to keep a custom cache location." = "将旧文件夹中的 `Cache`、`Thumbnails` 以及任何来源文件夹（例如“macOS 26”）拖到 `Aerial-migrate` 中。可选：同时拖入 `Preferences/com.glouel.Aerial.plist`，以保留自定义缓存位置。";
"Click **Continue**. Aerial sorts the files into /Users/Shared/Aerial and removes `Aerial-migrate`." = "点击**继续**。Aerial 会把文件整理到 /Users/Shared/Aerial，并移除 `Aerial-migrate`。";
"Finder can reach the old folder even though Aerial can't. Pick what you'd like to do." = "访达可以访问旧文件夹，Aerial 则不能。请选择你要执行的操作。";
"macOS restricts access to the old screen saver's folder, so the automatic migration can't start on its own. **Grant Access** opens a system file panel on that folder — just click **Grant Access** there, nothing to select. Aerial then carries over your videos, sources and settings as usual." = "macOS 限制对旧屏幕保护程序文件夹的访问，因此自动迁移无法自行开始。**授予访问权限**会在该文件夹上打开系统文件面板，在那里点击**授予访问权限**即可，无需选择任何内容。随后 Aerial 会照常迁移你的视频、来源和设置。";
"macOS 27 restricts access to the old screen saver's folder, so the automatic migration can't start on its own. **Grant Access** opens a system file panel on that folder — just click **Grant Access** there, nothing to select. Aerial then carries over your videos, sources and settings as usual." = "macOS 27 限制对旧屏幕保护程序文件夹的访问，因此自动迁移无法自行开始。**授予访问权限**会在该文件夹上打开系统文件面板，在那里点击**授予访问权限**即可，无需选择任何内容。随后 Aerial 会照常迁移你的视频、来源和设置。";
"Aerial 4 is configured. Press *Get Started* to head into the app — Aerial lives in your Dock, and the Video Library is its main window. Home shows what's playing on each display; pick and control what should play from there, or launch the wallpaper mode !" = "Aerial 4 已配置完成。点击*开始使用*进入应用。Aerial 会待在 Dock 中，视频库是它的主窗口。首页会显示每台显示器正在播放的内容，你可以从中选择和控制播放，或启动墙纸模式！";
"I **strongly** recommend you check the settings first (Aerial menu → *Settings…*, or the gear button in the window's toolbar). While similar in many ways to the previous version, many features have been entirely rethought/adapted and will need to be adjusted again to your liking." = "我**强烈建议**你先检查设置（Aerial 菜单 → *设置…*，或窗口工具栏中的齿轮按钮）。虽然许多方面与上一版相似，但很多功能已经重新设计或调整，需要你重新按喜好设置。";
"Closing the window keeps Aerial running in the background — downloads, overlays and auto-pause keep working. While you're in the Video Library, check out the new features, including new high quality videos in 4K 240 fps !" = "关闭窗口后 Aerial 仍会在后台运行，下载、叠加层和自动暂停会继续工作。在视频库中，你可以查看新功能，包括 4K 240 帧的高质量新视频！";
"Aerial 4 is configured. Press *Get Started* to head into the app, it will show up in your menu bar. You can pick and control what should play directly from the menu bar, or launch the wallpaper mode from there !" = "Aerial 4 已配置完成。点击*开始使用*进入应用，它会出现在菜单栏中。你可以直接从菜单栏选择和控制播放内容，或从那里启动墙纸模式！";
"I **strongly** recommend you check the settings first (bottom left of the menu). While similar in many ways to the previous version, many features have been entirely rethought/adapted and will need to be adjusted again to your liking." = "我**强烈建议**你先检查设置（菜单左下角）。虽然许多方面与上一版相似，但很多功能已经重新设计或调整，需要你重新按喜好设置。";
"Then head to the Video Library to check more of the new features, including new high quality videos in 4K 240 fps !" = "然后前往视频库查看更多新功能，包括 4K 240 帧的高质量新视频！";
"Aerial is still free and open source. If you enjoy it, check out the about box for more information on how you can support it's development." = "Aerial 仍然免费且开源。如果你喜欢它，可以查看“关于”窗口，了解如何支持它的开发。";

