"Quit Aerial?" = "退出 Aerial？";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Close Window Instead" = "改为关闭窗口";
"Don't ask again" = "不再询问";
"Existing Folder Renamed" = "已重命名现有文件夹";
"Start Fresh?" = "重新开始？";
"Your existing data will remain in the old location but won't be used. You can delete it manually later if desired." = "现有数据会保留在旧位置，但不会再被使用。之后如有需要，可以手动删除。";
"Nothing to trim" = "没有可裁剪的内容";
"Every cached video is either a favourite or playing right now, so the cache can't be trimmed any further." = "每个已缓存视频要么是收藏，要么正在播放，因此缓存无法继续裁剪。";
"Please choose a different folder" = "请选择其他文件夹";
"This folder is the mount point Aerial uses for the external cache image. Choose the folder that should hold the cache instead." = "此文件夹是 Aerial 用于外部缓存映像的挂载点。请选择应存放缓存的其他文件夹。";
"This folder can't hold the cache image" = "此文件夹无法存放缓存映像";
"Move the videos in this folder into a disk image?" = "将此文件夹中的视频移入磁盘映像？";
"Convert" = "转换";
"Change cache location?" = "更改缓存位置？";
"Move existing videos" = "移动现有视频";
"Start fresh (keep old)" = "重新开始（保留旧数据）";
"Move the videos in this folder to the default location?" = "将此文件夹中的视频移动到默认位置？";
"Move" = "移动";
"Resume Wallpaper" = "恢复墙纸";
"Pause Wallpaper" = "暂停墙纸";
"Your wallpaper and screensaver keep running — they live in a macOS extension, not in this app.\n\nQuitting Aerial stops what the app itself takes care of in the background: video downloads, automatic pause when windows cover the wallpaper, live overlay data (weather, now playing) and keyboard shortcuts.\n\nYou can close the window instead and keep Aerial running in the Dock." = "你的墙纸和屏幕保护程序会继续运行——它们位于 macOS 扩展中，不在这个应用里。\n\n退出 Aerial 会停止应用本身在后台负责的工作：视频下载、窗口遮挡墙纸时自动暂停、实时叠加层数据（天气、正在播放）以及键盘快捷键。\n\n你也可以改为关闭窗口，让 Aerial 继续在 Dock 中运行。";
"We found an existing /Users/Shared/Aerial/ folder that wasn't created by Aerial.\n\nTo preserve your data, we've renamed it to:\n%@\n\nAerial will now use /Users/Shared/Aerial/ for its data." = "我们发现了一个不是由 Aerial 创建的现有 /Users/Shared/Aerial/ 文件夹。\n\n为了保护你的数据，我们已将其重命名为：\n%@\n\nAerial 现在会使用 /Users/Shared/Aerial/ 存放数据。";
"Aerial is free and open source. Expansions are extra video packs from independent artists — some are free, others are paid. Buying a paid expansion supports both the creator and Aerial's continued development. It's how we keep the project moving without ads or telemetry." = "Aerial 免费且开源。扩展包是独立创作者制作的额外视频包，有些免费，有些付费。购买付费扩展既能支持创作者，也能支持 Aerial 的持续开发。我们靠这种方式让项目在没有广告和遥测的情况下继续前进。";
